Dear {{recipient_name}},

The next progress review for {{apprentice_name}} is booked for {{review_date}} at {{review_time}}, at {{review_location}}.

A review needs all three of us: the apprentice, you as the employer, and {{tutor_name}} for the provider. It is a funding requirement that the employer takes part, so if the date does not work please tell us now and we will move it.

We will cover progress against the standard, off-the-job hours, English and maths, and what the next three months should look like. Nothing needs preparing in advance.

{{tutor_name}}
{{provider_name}}
